eline-main","title":"Fog Covers the Path","description":"Fog rolls over the mire and threatens to make the trap impossible.","locationMarkerId":"hound-loc-grimpen","involvedCharacterIds":["hound-char-holmes","hound-char-watson","hound-char-lestrade"],"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"involvedItemIds":[],"tags":["chapter-14"],"threadIds":["hound-thread-hound","hound-thread-investigation"],"motifIds":["hound-motif-moor","hound-motif-captivity"],"sortOrder":10,"travelDays":0,"inWorldTime":279,"tension":4,"structureBeat":null,"status":"final","povCharacterId":"hound-char-watson","isFlashback":false},{"worldId":"hound-world","createdAt":1785585600000,"updatedAt":1785585600000,"id":"hound-event-59","chapterId":"hound-chapter-14","timelineId":"hound-timeline-main","title":"The Hound Attacks","description":"The glowing hound charges Sir Henry; Holmes fires and kills it before it can finish the attack.","locationMarkerId":"hound-loc-merripit","involvedCharacterIds":["hound-char-holmes","hound-char-watson","hound-char-lestrade","hound-char-sir-henry"],"mentionedCharacterIds":[],"involvedItemIds":["hound-item-hound","hound-item-phosphorus","hound-item-revolver","hound-item-old-boot"],"tags":["chapter-14"],"threadIds":["hound-thread-hound","hound-thread-stapleton","hound-thread-inheritance"],"motifIds":["hound-motif-reason-superstition","hound-motif-footprints","hound-motif-light"],"sortOrder":20,"travelDays":0,"inWorldTime":279,"tension":5,"structureBeat":"climax","status":"final","povCharacterId":"hound-char-watson","isFlashback":false},{"worldId":"hound-world","createdAt":1785585600000,"updatedAt":1785585600000,"id":"hound-event-60","chapterId":"hound-chapter-14","timelineId":"hound-timeline-main","title":"Beryl Is Rescued","description":"The investigators find Beryl bound and beaten; she directs them to Stapleton’s island in the mire.","locationMarkerId":"hound-loc-merripit","involvedCharacterIds":["hound-char-holmes","hound-char-watson","hound-char-lestrade","hound-char-beryl","